.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX07n0006_pb205a01","n":"b205a","t":"如繪畫一幅佛像雖圖畫本非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX07n0006_pb206a01","n":"b206a","t":"中非無故在四勝義中亦作是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX07n0006_pb208a01","n":"b208a","t":"熏成當來世之器界與根身之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX07n0006_pb209a01","n":"b209a","t":"在即是隨心變化皆得成就然"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX07n0006_pb211a01","n":"b211a","t":"法得久住世於相似佛法之魔"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX07n0006_pb213a01","n":"b213a","t":"默如記廈門慈宗學會印行附"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-太虛-第六編-瑜伽真實義品講要","source":"CBETA TX07n0006 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":300,"unit":"TX7 頁欄"}